  "annotations": [
    {
      "id": "desktop-row-1",
      "x": -440,
      "y": 0,
      "w": 340,
      "text": "01 · Entry\nLanding with the one-shot pin morph and squiggle, sign in and sign up with visible labels.",
      "page": "desktop"
    },
    {
      "id": "desktop-row-2",
      "x": -440,
      "y": 2280,
      "w": 340,
      "text": "02 · Home\nDashboard with popular places, both trip statuses on every card, and the coral New Trip FAB. Collections and Profile share the nav.",
      "page": "desktop"
    },
    {
      "id": "desktop-row-3",
      "x": -440,
      "y": 3840,
      "w": 340,
      "text": "03 · Trip Board\nThe core screen. Edit mode with a selected card and an open transport menu, view mode with the route summary, dark mode filtered to Day 2, and the two dialogs.",
      "page": "desktop"
    },
    {
      "id": "desktop-row-4",
      "x": -440,
      "y": 4960,
      "w": 340,
      "text": "04 · Sharing\nShare as a link or as a News story; the public read-only board and its unavailable state.",
      "page": "desktop"
    },
    {
      "id": "desktop-row-5",
      "x": -440,
      "y": 6080,
      "w": 340,
      "text": "05 · News\nEditorial stories plus a traveller’s shared trip plan; the article view.",
      "page": "desktop"
    },
    {
      "id": "mobile-row-1",
      "x": -440,
      "y": 0,
      "w": 340,
      "text": "01 · Entry\nFull-width actions, 16 px gutters, no fake status bar.",
      "page": "mobile"
    },
    {
      "id": "mobile-row-2",
      "x": -440,
      "y": 2300,
      "w": 340,
      "text": "02 · Home\nA bottom tab bar replaces the top segmented nav; your boards come before popular places; forms open as bottom sheets.",
      "page": "mobile"
    },
    {
      "id": "mobile-row-3",
      "x": -440,
      "y": 4420,
      "w": 340,
      "text": "03 · Trip Board\nPanels become bottom sheets over a full-bleed canvas: places while editing, the route summary while viewing.",
      "page": "mobile"
    },
    {
      "id": "mobile-row-4",
      "x": -440,
      "y": 5484,
      "w": 340,
      "text": "04 · News",
      "page": "mobile"
    },
    {
      "id": "system-row-1",
      "x": -440,
      "y": 0,
      "w": 340,
      "text": "Design system v2\nFoundations, components, states and the live SVG morph sheet (hover and click the stages).",
      "page": "system"
    }
